[CIV1-UI-086] UNIT STACK ACTIVATION
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                    UNITS IN THIS SQUARE                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
| > Legion        Fortified                                  |
|   Phalanx       Sentry                                     |
|   Settlers      Active                                     |
|                                                            |
|                  [ ACTIVATE ] [ DONE ]                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------+

[CIV1-UI-087] GO TO DESTINATION TARGETING
+=============================================================================+
|                          SELECT DESTINATION                                 |
+=============================================================================+
| ~ ~ . . . . . . . .                                                       |
| . . [U] . . . . . .                                                       |
| . . . . . . . . .                                                        |
| . . . . . . [X] . .       X = destination cursor                           |
|                                                                             |
|                         [ SET ] [ CANCEL ]                                   |
+=============================================================================+

